Using Recursion

def mul(a, b):
if b == 1;
return a
else:
return a + mul(a, b - 1)

print(mul(5, 6))

Factorial Program:-

def fact(number):
if number == 1:
return 1
else:
return number * fact(number - 1)
print(fact(5))

